== diagnostics ==
E0102 [Error] 727..743 this string never closes
    label it opens here, and an interpolation `{` inside it is still open when the line ends
    note a `"…"` string — and every `{…}` interpolation inside it — must close before the line ends. Close the interpolation with `}` and the string with `"`; for a literal brace, write `{{`.
    note this string carries `${`: `$` is an ordinary character and escapes nothing, so the `{` after it opens an interpolation like any other. Write `${{` for a literal `${` — the brace escape, one byte later than it looks.
